    1. Activity / Status: the same MT_SYS_LOV lookup as inline scalar
       subqueries (no UDF call per row). The status list name is a CASE
       on AE_metaModelType2 that the SP builds once per call from the live
       CDMS_ACT_LOV_TypCatDecode (mm -1..30, 32 calls) into @StatusCase.
       (Revision 2, 2026-10-23: the hardcoded CASE of revision 1 was
       refused by G1 on UAT; types 2, 4, 11, 13 differed.)
    2. Outer re-join of BT_CUSTOMER_MASTER removed: [Customer Name] =
       A.[Cutomer Name] (the same PK row, already joined in every branch).
    3. @SqlString VARCHAR(5000) -> VARCHAR(MAX).
